      55.17,
      411.78,
      295.19,
      464.94
    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms, hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is requiredfor a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions ofthat Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      476.58,
      295.21,
      551.34
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land in extent of 0.2200 Hectare, depicted asLot A in the Advance Tracing No. R/KLN/2014/319 dated 05.02.2015,prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village calledKahawatta (F.V.P. 901) in the Minor Division of KolonnaGampattuwa of Kolonna Korale in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Divisionof Kolonna in Ratnapura District in Sabaragamuwa Province andbounded as follows:",
